# Installed Skills

Curated index of agent skills installed under `.agents/skills/`. Each skill is a folder containing a `SKILL.md`. Load a skill with `cloud_read_skill("<name>")` where `<name>` is the folder name (the skill's identity).

No default skill — pick the one that fits the task.

---

## Skill catalog

| Skill (folder) | One-line purpose | Source |
|---|---|---|
| caveman | Compress response style for token efficiency while preserving all technical detail, code, and commands. Opt-in via "caveman mode". | (already installed) |
