---

## Notes

- Folder name = skill identity for `cloud_read_skill("<name>")`. The `source` column points to the upstream repo; the canonical upstream skill name may differ (see each skill's own `note` in its frontmatter).
- Several upstream repos ship *multiple* skills or a suite (e.g. superpowers, brag, browser-use, ponytail, ecc, agentic-awesome-skills). This project installs **one skill per repo**, chosen as the most generally useful one, under the folder name that matches the existing `.md` stub. Other upstream skills in those repos are not installed here.
- A few upstream repos were not a single SKILL.md (awesome-design = DESIGN.md collection, ui-ux-pro-max = skill.json manifest, claude-code-best-practice = guide markdown, agentic-awesome-skills = registry index, impeccable = SKILL.src.md template + toolchain). For those, this index's skill was built from the best available instruction file in the repo.
- claude-mem is an OpenClaw-gateway plugin guide; it is not a Claude-Code workflow skill by default.
- caveman was already installed before this refresh; the other 14 were installed/converted from the `.agents/*.md` stubs during this session.
